      "body": "This should definitely not happen. The intention is that a user sees only addresses they have used themselves. Nothing should be shared there. https://github.com/nextcloud/mail/blob/0abf6d3110904cf2a0eac337fdb406e329372248/lib/db/collectedaddressmapper.php#L44-L51 _should_ scope the search to only find addresses that belong to the current user.\n",
